#: cps/templates/cwa_settings.html:188
#, fuzzy
msgid "Automatic Metadata Fetching"
msgstr "Automatisches Abrufen von Metadaten für neue Bücher aktivieren"

#: cps/templates/cwa_settings.html:190
msgid "Automatically fetches metadata for newly ingested books"
